### PRODUCT TEST

### GET PRODUCT
### GET ALL PRODUCTS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product
### GET PRODUCT BY STORE
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product?storeId=13
### GET PRODUCT BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/product/15

### CREATE PRODUCT
### CREATE PRODUCT WITHOUT TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pen",
    "description": "Blue pen",
    "price": 5,
    "stock_quantity": 120
}
